# The agent model for this repo, built by `make model`.
#
# Claude Code needs a tool-capable model with a 64k+ context window. Ollama's
# default context is far smaller, and a context that is too short makes the
# agent forget CLAUDE.md mid-session -- which looks like the model ignoring
# rules when it is actually the harness truncating them. Baking num_ctx into
# a named build means every student gets the same window regardless of their
# shell environment.
#
# Override the base with `make model BASE=qwen3.5:27b` on a machine with
# 32 GB or more. See README.md for the size table.
FROM qwen3.5:9b
PARAMETER num_ctx 65536
